<title>USA: TABLE-Dorsey Trailers Q2 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Dorsey Trailers Q2 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr	  loss n/a		loss  n/a</p>
<p> Net	  loss 3,000	    loss  1,400</p>
<p> Sales	     40,000		   38,900</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr	  loss n/a		loss  n/a</p>
<p> Net	  loss 8,500	    loss  2,600</p>
<p> Sales	     81,000		   79,900</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTES: The company did not provide per share figures in its press statement, but chief financial officer Charles Chitwood said over the telephone that the company had a $0.60 loss for the 1997 second quarter, compared to a loss of $0.27 in 1996 Q2, and that the company had a year-to-date loss of $1.70 loss, compared to a loss of $0.53 loss for the same period in 1996.</p>
<p>Full co name is Dorsey Trailers Inc</p>
</text>
